{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Culture, Myths, and Legends", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Writing a Short Narrative", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe detailed facts about events or actions in work and social contexts, in written or spoken situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "  Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Writes effective and clear texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Writing in the Unreal Past", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you want to write about a hypothetical situation in the past, you use the Past Perfect tense. You can also use the word <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">wish </span></span>to talk about things that didn't happen, but you wanted to happen.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">If only she hadn't lied to him</span>. (= She lied and now he doesn't trust her.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">What if we had got lost in the woods? </span> <br/>(We didn't, but have an idea of how badly it could have turned out!)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When we use the verb <span class=\"strong\"> to wish </span>it can also followed by the Past Perfect tense. This shows that we want our present situation to be different.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I wish I had finished my degree at university. (= but I didn't finish it)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I wish I had more to give you but we are simple people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I was less trusting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wish I was a more forgiving person.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If only the family had known what darkness would befall their wintery home. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If only I hadn't been so welcoming to the visitor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If only I had been a stronger man I would have kept you close.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "igloo", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a house made of blocks of snow or ice in the form of a dome", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A long time ago, a young stranger came into a family igloo.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in myths and legends.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "canine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to dogs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Around his neck was a leather strip with two large canine teeth.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "caribou", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a large type of deer that lives in northern parts of the world", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Anyone who braves this weather is considered a friend and is provided with caribou stew.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tracks", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a mark left on the ground by a moving animal", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: All that remained were animal tracks outside.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to paddle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move a boat forward in the water with a stick with a flat end", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He paddled the canoe to a small island and left her there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pregnant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a baby", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: To his horror, as time passed he realized that his daughter, Sedna, was pregnant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "seal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large animal with flippers that lives on the sea or on the coast", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These fingers became seals in the sea. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "walrus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large animal that lives on land and in the sea in northern regions and that has flippers and long tusks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her hands became walruses. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "forearm", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the part of the arm between the elbow and the wrist", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When she made one last daring attempt to get into the boat her father sliced through her forearms.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "whale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an very large mammal which lives in the ocean", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They turned into whales.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le11ob08aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online or to your local library and research other Inuit legends.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one legend that you are interested in. Does the legend talk about caribou, seals or whales?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write half a page of notes on what the legend is about. Who are the characters? What happens?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Now write a paragraph in your own words based on the legend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research Inuit legends.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write notes on the legend and then use those notes to write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph about a legend to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Narrative", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">narrative</span> is a story. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "It uses a sequence of events to tell the story.<br/>The story is told by a narrator in either the 1st person (about their experience), or the 3rd person (about someone else's experience). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A narrative paints a picture of the events  through the use of character, setting and plot.<br/>These are enhanced by the use of descriptive words and phrases (adjectives and adverbs).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Folktales and fairytales are classic narratives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Parts of a Narrative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Character\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"person or thing with human characteristics in a story\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Setting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"where the story happens\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plot\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the storyline featuring a beginning, middle and end\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can write a short narrative.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about myths and legends in different cultures.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about past situations that did not happen. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  Why do you think people keep legends alive?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  How important do you think myths and legends are to a society?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: An Inuit Legend", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nThe Inuit from Northern Canada have their own myths and legends to explain the world around them.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "DFL", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "I wish I had more to give you but we are simple people.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "If only the family had known what darkness would befall their wintery home. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 2}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "I wish I was a more forgiving person.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 3}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "If only I hadn't been so welcoming to the visitor.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 4}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "If only I had been a stronger man I would have kept you close.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 5}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "I wish I was less trusting.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 6}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Past situations that did NOT happen", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "As they were coming back, a  storm threatened to capsize the overloaded canoe.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "The father decided that he would have to throw his daughter overboard. ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 2}, {"text": "", "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "She caught hold of the boat and tried to climb back in.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 3}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Past situations that DID happen", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nDreams and legends have always played an important part in the lives of Inuit.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": "", "type": "DFL_background_image"}, {"content": "", "type": "exercise_background_image"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the sentences and move them into the correct category.\n<br/> You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 2, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "MT1", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "engenn10le11ob08re4img01.jpg", "type": "image"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le11ob08re3aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id"