ed with caribou stew and a place to lay their head. I wish I\nhad more to give you but we are a simple people\u201d, the father said. The stranger\nwas also given a slice of bread by one of the daughters. If only the family had\nknown what darkness would befall their wintry home.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "In the morning, the young man was gone. All that remained were animal tracks outside. The father exclaimed, \"Were we deceived? Was he really an animal who took the shape of a man? I wish I was less trusting.\" To his horror, as time passed he realized that his daughter, Sedna, was pregnant. \u201cIf only I hadn't been so welcoming to the visitor,\u201c he mumbled to his wife. The father and daughter got into their canoe. He paddled to a small island and left her there. Later that summer, the father returned to the island to collect her.", "time": "36000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "As they were coming back, a  storm threatened to capsize the overloaded canoe. The\nfather decided that if he wanted to survive the storm, he would have to throw his daughter overboard. Sedna was a strong swimmer. She caught hold of the boat and tried to climb back in. Her father took out his knife and cut off her fingers. These fingers became seals in the sea. When she reached in again, he cut off her hands. These became walruses. When she made one last daring attempt to get into the boat her father sliced through her forearms. These were transformed into whales.", "time": "78000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn10le11ob08re2img03.jpg", "text": "Sedna sank down, down, down into the sea. Her father cried out, \u201cIf only I had been\na stronger man I would have kept you close.\u201d\n<br>Sedna was transformed as she sank into the  sea, becoming half-woman and half-fish. Sometimes, if you look carefully after a storm, you can see her swimming alongside the sea animals she controls.", "time": "122000", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn10le10ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "Writing a Short Narrative", "time": "5000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What is a legend?</span>", "time": "10000", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Narratives</span>", "time": "44000", "id": 3}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What should a narrative include?</span>", "time": "60000", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}